6	//   PRIME2 : basis over PRIME, same tenors
7	// Quotes are generated from a known set of forwards, so the joint solve must recover them. The MULTI-CURVE
8	// basis pricing (the new Stage-3 kernel) is additionally oracle-checked against QuantLib's own multi-curve
9	// OIS fair spread. SOFR/FF futures reuse the single-curve kernel already validated to 1e-16 (pricing_test).
